Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?UTF-8?q?=E2=9C=A8=20Add=20optional=20XDNA2=20infere?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nce=20with=20graceful=20session=20recovery?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Keep the LADSPA audio and control ABI while delegating spectral inference to an optional per-user broker.
- Fall back to CPU at the audio deadline and retain the exclusive lease until the XRT worker finishes cleanup.
- Close idle sessions and open a fresh one when audio resumes.

Verified with Rust tests, a CPU-only build check, private-bus lifecycle tests for both models, and production XRT counters.
